{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"正月太りしてしまった人も\n明日からダイエット始めればまだ大丈夫！\nまだ助かりますよ！\nまだ助かる...まだ助かる...マダガスカル！\nそれ！ダダダダダダ...ダン！\nここ！マダガスカル！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ということで！34回目のファンの方が\n考えてくださった今日の冒頭あいさつは\nペイマさんから頂きました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとうございます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/01/18/2868373/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は昨日日奈子におきた悲しい話をするね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日ドラッグストアでボディクリームを買ったんだけど、自分の分と妹の分を買って\n違う種類のにしたから\n妹に\n「ボディクリーム買ってきたよ～♪\n違う種類にしたの！いい香りだよ～♪」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"って言いながらボディクリームの蓋をあけて香りを嗅ごうとしたら\n「プシュっっっっ」ってなって\n「はっっっっ。」ってなって\n心臓が止まりかけました。。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そのプシュっっって出たクリームが\n鼻にびしゃっっっとついて。。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"その写真がこちらです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/01/18/2868373/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すっぴんですが\n悲しかったので\n載せちゃいます"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/01/18/2868373/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/01/18/2868373/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すごーくすごく悲しくて\n妹とお母さんはびっくりして\n私は大笑いしてました。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"悲しかったのは5分間くらい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そのあとは、大笑い！笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"へへへ(｡-∀-｡)♪笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/01/18/2868373/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日も！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ヒナコセレクト(仮)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/01/18/2868373/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◆たけちゃんまんさん◆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◁雪合戦したことある？しよーぜーーー！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"▶︎最後にしたのは去年の2月に家族で行った\n北海道の時で、札幌のおばあちゃん家の家の前でした！！！お兄ちゃんと妹と夜中に！\n今年もしたいな～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◆でるたつさん◆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◁昨日の『乃木坂工事中』で\n「内輪ウケものまね大賞」\nという企画がありましたが、\nきいちゃんなら、どんなモノマネをしますか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"▶︎まいちゅんと純奈と未央奈とみり愛のモノマネできる！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◆カワーさん◆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◁じょしらくのキグちゃんのセリフで、いま大声で叫びたいのは何？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"▶︎公園！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◆SQ46さん◆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◁ダイエットするときでも、絶対に抜けない食べ物は何ですか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"▶︎アイス！甘いもの！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◆もっちんさん◆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◁では、お好み焼きともんじゃ焼きならどっちが好き？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"▶︎お好み焼き！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◆まるでぃ こんぺい党さん◆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◁雪は美味しいですか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"▶︎美味しくない雪に出会ったことないです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◆ゆうたさん◆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◁きいちゃんのダイエットは\nいつになっても始まらないと\nファンの間で囁かれてるとかなんとか...\nいつやるの？←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"▶︎明日から！明日から！明日から！\nよし！絶対！明日から！\n決めた！決めたよ！\n明日から少しでも油断しそうになったら\nメールする！！！よし！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◆0244さん◆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◁きみとしろみはオス、メスなのー？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"▶︎きみもしろみもメスだよー！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◆まきさん◆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◁きぃちゃんは炭水化物の中で何が1番好きですか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"▶︎うーん、パンとかケーキとか！甘いの！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◆ハシモンさん◆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◁きぃちゃんの発音って、｢きぃちゃん↑｣と｢きぃちゃん↓｣どっちですか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"▶︎きいちゃん↑だと思います！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◆しゅういちろうさん◆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◁のぎ中の妄想クリスマスの留守電\nなんで弓道部限定だったのー？？\n俺の友達は弓道で喜んでたよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"▶︎私が通ってた学校には弓道部がなかったからです！見たことも弓道部をやってる人にも会ったことがないから、なんとなく弓道部にしました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◆棚からよもぎ餅さん◆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◁カートゥーンだと、『デクスターズラボ』と『チキチキマシン猛レース』が好きだった！きいちゃん知ってる？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"▶︎知らない！！！毎日、おかしなガムボールとパワーパフガールズ録画してみてる！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◆じゅんだいさん◆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◁ずーと思ってたんだけどねー、冒頭のあいさつとか締めのあいさつとかヒナセレって、前日のブログからえらんでるのぉー？それとも昔のから、いいなぁって思ったやつをメモしといて選んだりしてるのぉー？教えて欲しいなぁ♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"▶︎基本は前日のブログのコメントからだけど、他のブログのコメントが増えててそこをみて、何かあったらそこからも選んだりするよ！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◆とりさん◆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◁ダイエット何回言ってるの？(笑)\nけっこう前から言ってるよね(。-∀-)\nアイスをやめなさいアイスを(゜д゜)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"▶︎ごめんなさい。明日から絶対やめます(ノ_・。)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/01/18/2868373/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日のヒナコセレクト(仮)は\nこれでおわりです！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/01/18/2868373/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あなたに1番近い星"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私たち"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/01/18/2868373/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"サンクエトワールです"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/01/18/2868373/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ファンの方が考えてくださった\nブログ締めのあいさつ\n27回目はチョモランマさんからです！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさん、今日も日奈子のブログを読んでくださってありがとうございました。\nこのあとは夢の中でお会いしましょう！\nおやすみ～"}],"source":"archive"}